  "title": "Ukraine and Russia: Escalated Conflict Over Starlink and Drone Attacks",
  "summary": "Ukraine intensified its aerial attacks on Russian tech giant Yandex, marking its third strike on the company’s infrastructure. Meanwhile, Ukraine’s president criticized the U.S.-Russia diesel deal as a 'gift to Putin,' while President Trump defended the deal as necessary to secure energy supplies, amid growing tensions over Ukraine’s military access to Starlink satellite internet. Russia and Ukraine also accused each other of attacking commercial vessels, while the EU and Russia extended sanctions on Russian oligarchs, with a deadline to preserve the sanctions.",
